{"id": "EUVD-2024-55820", "enisaUuid": "eb67d595-ae66-3d7e-b96f-57b9957bdc29", "description": "i-Netsolution Readymade Unilevel Ecommerce MLM (2024-03-15 build) contains an SQL injection vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to manipulate database queries through the 'id' parameter. Attackers can send GET requests to /product-details.php with boolean-based, stacked, or time-based SLEEP payloads in 'id' to extract database information. Exploitation evidence was first observed by the Shadowserver Foundation on 2024-09-14.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:36", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://packetstorm.news/files/id/179886/", "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/other/readymade-unilevel-sqli.yaml", "https://i-netsolution.com/product-details/readymade-unilevel-ecommerce-mlm", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/i-netsolution-readymade-unilevel-ecommerce-mlm-sql-injection-via-product-details-php"], "aliases": ["CVE-2024-58393", "GHSA-83x3-gcgq-gcgq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8a624b66-8a1b-3559-ace2-c1a756762bda", "product": {"name": "Readymade Unilevel Ecommerce MLM", "vendor": {"name": "i-Netsolution"}}, "product_version": "2024-03-15 build"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "dce61288-64e3-3a19-ada8-4fe83919ceda", "vendor": {"name": "i-Netsolution"}}], "isExploited": false}